# eyecansee
===
 A viewer and manager for photos, videos, 3D models and CAD drawings, with an image editor, for Linux and Windows, written in Rust: browse, convert, find duplicates, annotate images and cover private data, copy and move between folders, disks, SFTP/FTP servers and Android phones. On Linux: Flatpak, Fedora COPR and AppImage..
